// ---- Inner life ----
// Wound, fear, motivation and the inner-conflict sentence roll together,
// so the sentence always repeats what was rolled. The three lists are
// independent, so they can be any length.

Table: Character Core
Set: wound=[@CharWound]
Set: fear=[@CharFear]
Set: motivation=[@CharMotivation]
<b>Emotional Wound:</b> {$wound}<br><b>Fear:</b> {$fear}<br><b>Motivation:</b> {$motivation}<br><b>Inner Conflict:</b> Driven by {$motivation}, but afraid of {$fear}, because of {$wound}.

